# Sent with every file of the list. Cloudflare reads this file and does not
# serve it.
#
# The list is open data, read by pages on other sites, survey.p-lens.jp and
# app.p-lens.jp among them, so any site may read it.
#
# Each file is sent with its version in ETag, which changes when the file
# does. A page on another site is let read it, so app.p-lens.jp can ask what
# version a file is at — a HEAD request, a few hundred bytes — and read the
# megabytes only when it has moved.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Expose-Headers: ETag
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/*.jsonl
  Content-Type: application/x-ndjson; charset=utf-8
